# Crash Twinsanity (56550036), Thor. DRAFT by lane.routeprep, 2026-09-26,
# not played. One file: New Game does not need a save; if the game offers
# to create one, the A at that step accepts it and a later run sees the same
# path (New Game is still the first item).
#
# Evidence: titlebench hands-off 240 s (0-0-y-1790416653-titlebench-20,
# Thor), one frame per ~10 s in frames/: f02 Vivendi, f03 Traveller's Tales,
# f04-f05 "THREE YEARS AGO..." intro, f06-f11 "PRESS START BUTTON" (~60-110
# s), f12-f16 attract gameplay clips, f17-f18 the intro again, f19-f24 the
# title again. Nothing past the title is on disk.
wait 55
shot boot55
wait 10
shot boot65                 # expect "PRESS START BUTTON" [seen f06]
mark booted
press START
wait 6
shot main-menu              # [guess] New Game first
press A
wait 6
shot after-new-game         # OPEN: a save-slot / "create save" prompt
press A                     # [guess] accept
wait 8
shot after-save
press A                     # [guess] dismiss a notice, or nothing
wait 10
shot story
mark new-game
# [guess] the opening cutscene (it is long); A is tried, START is not (it
# would pause gameplay once control starts).
repeat 12 {
    press A
    wait 6
    shot story-a
}
mark gameplay               # [guess] placeholder: move to the first frame with Crash under control
# Platformer: run, jump (A), spin (B or X).
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 1.5
    press A
    wait 0.8
    press X
    wait 0.5
    axis LY mid
    axis LX max
    wait 1
    press B
    wait 0.5
    axis LX min
    wait 1
    axis LX mid
}
